      "description": "h3. Summary\r\n\r\nCookies for session stickiness that is for \"child domains\" (starts with dots, see RFC6265) are filtered out on IOS Jira Server Mobile 1.16. As result after auth in WebView, rest calls got on wrong node and client receives 401 (unauth) causing Session Expire loop.\r\nh3. Impacts\r\n * data-center instances\r\n * session stickiness based on domain with allowed subdomains (aka starts from dot)\r\n\r\ne.g. SSO returns\r\n\r\n{{Set-Cookie: session_cookie=some-guid;Domain=.foo.bar}}\r\nh3. Workaround\r\n\r\nAbsent, please use web client and watch this issue. If you use Jira iOS 1.15.0 or older version, don't update the app to new versions for a while. \r\n\r\nThe fix in iOS mobile client is needed.",
