      "description": "h3. Issue Summary\r\n\r\nThe issue with the custom date picker field. When modifying the date by typing in 0020-08-07. It will show 05/Aug/20 instead 07/Aug/20.\r\nh3. Steps to Reproduce\r\n # Step 1\r\n Modify the date in a custom date picker field by typing in 0020-08-07.\r\n # Step 2\r\n Then click on the tick box. The date will show 05/Aug/20 instead 07/Aug/20\r\n\r\nh3. Expected Results\r\n\r\n07/Aug/20\r\nh3. Actual Results\r\n\r\n05/Aug/20\r\nh3. Workaround\r\n Currently, there is no known workaround for this behavior. A workaround will be added here when available\r\n\r\n*Jira date picker and date look and feel settings*\r\n * Date picker advanced setting\r\n !image-2021-05-02-20-14-47-830.png|thumbnail!\r\n * Date look and feel setting\r\n !image-2021-05-02-20-15-43-008.png|thumbnail!",
